“**Revenue**” means the gross income before taxes that is attributable to  
Commercial Use of the Software.  
“**You** / **Your**” means any individual or legal entity exercising rights  
under this licence.  

1 ▌ FREE & OPEN-SOURCE USE
──────────────────────────
For **non-commercial** purposes, or within an **OSI-approved open-source  
