2 ▌ FAIR COMMERCIAL USE
───────────────────────
Commercial Use is permitted **only if** You fairly compensate the Author
according to the schedule below **or** obtain a separate written agreement.

▪ **Revenue-sharing schedule**  
  • Use *as-is* ………………… 15 % of related Revenue  
  • *Modified / improved* version ……… 10 %  
  • *Substantially re-worked* version, whose functionality clearly exceeds  
    the original ………………………………………… 5 % – or **0 %** if the original
    contribution is truly marginal (honour system).

▪ **Small-revenue exemption** If Your annual Revenue attributable to the
   Software is **below 10 000 €**, no payment is required.

▪ **Fixed buy-out option** You may, in lieu of sharing Revenue, negotiate a
   one-time licence fee with the Author.

▪ **Reporting & audit** Upon written request (no more than once per calendar
   year) You shall provide reasonable documentation of Revenue connected to
   the Software. The Author shall treat such information as confidential.

